  "note": "§5, read literally and stated in spec-011-implementation-notes.md: the Kind test on a cited authority applies to **every** act done under it, and issuing an Endorsement is an act of `core.r5e.io/v1/Endorsement`. So an authority scoped to one Kind does not let its holder mint authority for that Kind — `mayIssue` says the holder may issue, and `kinds` still says what it may admit. An authority that means to permit delegation names `core.r5e.io/v1/Endorsement` (or `*`).",
